<p>What can I say? This doesn't quite hit in my usual aversion to dream skips, possibly because the dream effects aren't central to the whole thing. There's <em>other</em> stuff going on here, is what I mean. The direct attempt to prevent reading meaning into it, coupled with the interview, actually brings this back to the soul of AWCY, I think. I mean, I can definitely see them getting mad about something like this.</p>
