<p>The most important things first: Curse you for making me upvote an AWCY? scip.</p>
<p>As for the scip itself, I really like it. I think the interview overdid it a bit on the exposition front but it was really enjoyable to read nevertheless. The interviews with the D-Class felt a bit clunky in comparison but ultimately I have to upvote because, seriously, <em>fuck</em> the over-interpretation of art. Sometimes the cigar is really just a fucking cigar.</p>

